    {"type":"V","evidence":"to which a system must conform","rewrite":"A requirement shall specify at least one objective criterion for verification, including: (a) the measurable output or state, (b) the stimulus or context that triggers it, (c) the method to observe or measure it, and (d) the pass/fail threshold or tolerance"}
  ]
